<title>BRAZIL: Bovespa sees 668.2 mln-real inflow in Dec.</title>
<headline>Bovespa sees 668.2 mln-real inflow in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sao Paulo Stock Exchange (Bovespa) said it registered net foreign capital inflows of 668.2 million reais in the first 20 days of December.</p>
<p>Foreign buys amounted to 3.542 billion reais in the period versus foreign sells of 2.874 billion reais, it said.</p>
<p>In November, the Bovespa saw net capital inflows of 312 million reais, it said.</p>
<p>So far this year, net foreign capital inflows have totalled 3.326 billion reais, the bolsa said.</p>
<p>-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415</p>
